Nieuwe Bouwen comfort en functionaliteit veranderde in een verrassend samenhangend ontwerp.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["architectuur","design","museumwoning"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Rotterdam_-_Huis_Sonneveld.jpg/1280px-Rotterdam_-_Huis_Sonneveld.jpg","caption":"Huis Sonneveld — Rotterdam - Huis Sonneveld","credit":"Fred Romero from Paris, France","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rotterdam_-_Huis_Sonneveld.jpg","license":"CC BY 2.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"631f08f6-48a8-5e5f-bf13-7e9ad1312172","inventory_key":"wikipedia:Zuid-Holland:lisserartmuseum:lisse","name":"LAM museum","city":"Lisse","province":"Zuid-Holland","street_address":"Keukenhof 14","postal_code":"2161 AN","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.lammuseum.nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Eten, drinken en winkelen krijgen een onverwachte hoofdrol in het LAM. Schilderijen, beelden, foto''s en installaties maken het alledaagse bijzonder. Je hoeft niets van kunst te weten: nieuwsgierig kijken is hier het beste begin.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","installaties","fotografie"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/LAM_2019-2.jpg/1280px-LAM_2019-2.jpg","caption":"LAM museum — LAM 2019-2","credit":"Vysotsky","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:LAM_2019-2.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"7bfde0cc-1bc8-5d12-a2c8-e102714496da","inventory_key":"museum-nl:marius-van-dokkum-museum","name":"Marius van Dokkum Museum","city":"Harderwijk","province":"Gelderland","street_address":"Academiestraat 14","postal_code":"3841 ES","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.mariusvandokkummuseum.nl/","latitude":52.348195,"longitude":5.618281,"summary":"Glimlach om de herkenbare wereld van Marius van Dokkum. Zijn schilderijen zitten vol menselijke trekjes, humor en zorgvuldig uitgewerkte details. Neem de tijd: achter een alledaags tafereel schuilt vaak nog een tweede verhaal.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["realisme","schilderkunst","kunstenaarsmuseum"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Harderwijk_-_Hortuspark_03_-_Marius_van_Dokkum_Museum_-_Linnaeustoren_-_Sint_Catharinakerk.jpg/1280px-Harderwijk_-_Hortuspark_03_-_Marius_van_Dokkum_Museum_-_Linnaeustoren_-_Sint_Catharinakerk.jpg","caption":"Marius van Dokkum Museum — Harderwijk - Hortuspark 03 - Marius van Dokkum Museum - Linnaeustoren - Sint Catharinakerk","credit":"Txllxt TxllxT","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Harderwijk_-_Hortuspark_03_-_Marius_van_Dokkum_Museum_-_Linnaeustoren_-_Sint_Catharinakerk.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"88ccf034-8bb3-5af0-978f-b43e50073eb5","inventory_key":"museum-nl:design-museum-den-bosch","name":"Design Museum Den Bosch","city":"''s-Hertogenbosch","province":"Noord-Brabant","street_address":"De Mortel 4","postal_code":"5211 HV","country":"NL","website_url":"https://designmuseum.nl/","latitude":51.685743,"longitude":5.30417,"summary":"Ontdek hoe ontwerpen onze wereld beïnvloeden. Keramiek en sieraden vormen belangrijke onderdelen van de collectie van Design Museum Den Bosch. Tentoonstellingen kijken verder: naar de ideeën, technologie en maatschappelijke keuzes achter vormgeving.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["design","keramiek","sieraden"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Museumkwartier%2C_Bierman_Henket_architecten%2C_foto-_Joep_Jacobs_%2814057447618%29_%282%29.jpg/1280px-Museumkwartier%2C_Bierman_Henket_architecten%2C_foto-_Joep_Jacobs_%2814057447618%29_%282%29.jpg","caption":"Design Museum Den Bosch — Museumkwartier, Bierman Henket architecten, foto- Joep Jacobs (14057447618) (2)","credit":"Bond van Nederlandse Architecten","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Museumkwartier,_Bierman_Henket_architecten,_foto-_Joep_Jacobs_(14057447618)_(2).jpg","license":"CC BY 2.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"f38df3ae-584e-59b9-8e8e-b12e56b71eb0","inventory_key":"museum-nl:villa-mondriaan","name":"Villa Mondriaan","city":"Winterswijk","province":"Gelderland","street_address":"Zonnebrink 4","postal_code":"7101 NC","country":"NL","website_url":"https://villamondriaan.nl/","latitude":51.971722,"longitude":6.723603,"summary":"Ontmoet Mondriaan voordat hij beroemd werd om lijnen en kleurvlakken. In zijn vroegere woonhuis ontdek je de ontwikkeling van de jonge schilder. Werk van andere kunstenaars laat zien hoe spannend het zoeken naar een eigen stijl kan zijn.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["kunstenaarsmuseum","schilderkunst","Piet Mondriaan"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Mondriaan_museum_Winterswijk_.jpg/1280px-Mondriaan_museum_Winterswijk_.jpg","caption":"Villa Mondriaan — Mondriaan museum Winterswijk ","credit":"Ciell","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mondriaan_museum_Winterswijk_.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"ab4966d6-7d00-51d0-893f-cbc99e983c8f","inventory_key":"museum-nl:fotomuseum-aan-het-vrijthof","name":"Fotomuseum aan het Vrijthof","city":"Maastricht","province":"Limburg","street_address":"Vrijthof 18","postal_code":"6211 LD","country":"NL","website_url":"https://fotomuseumaanhetvrijthof.nl/","latitude":50.848354,"longitude":5.688755,"summary":"Laat je meenemen door fotografen met een uitgesproken blik. Het Fotomuseum aan het Vrijthof presenteert wisselende tentoonstellingen waarin beeldverhalen centraal staan. De historische omgeving vormt een intiem decor voor een veelzijdig medium.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["fotografie"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Voorgevel_-_Maastricht_-_20149312_-_RCE.jpg/1280px-Voorgevel_-_Maastricht_-_20149312_-_RCE.jpg","caption":"Fotomuseum aan het Vrijthof — Voorgevel - Maastricht - 20149312 - RCE","credit":"G.Th. Delemarre","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Voorgevel_-_Maastricht_-_20149312_-_RCE.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"760fa7b6-2d12-5a3c-8e26-f1ddb9053704","inventory_key":"museum-nl:kasteel-huis-bergh","name":"Kasteel Huis Bergh","city":"''s-Heerenberg","province":"Gelderland","street_address":"Hof van Bergh 8","postal_code":"7041 AC","country":"NL","website_url":"https://huisbergh.nl/","latitude":51.874696,"longitude":6.240762,"summary":"Achter de kasteelmuren wacht een bijzondere kunstverzameling. Ontdek vroege schilderkunst, middeleeuwse handschriften en beeldsnijwerk. Huis Bergh maakt de verfijning van eeuwenoude beelden en verhalen van dichtbij zichtbaar.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["middeleeuwse kunst","oude meesters","manuscripten"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Huis_Bergh-2.JPG/1280px-Huis_Bergh-2.JPG","caption":"Kasteel Huis Bergh — Huis Bergh-2","credit":"Arch","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huis_Bergh-2.JPG","license":"Public domain"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"555af903-7bed-5d6e-b52e-de3b7909bc55","inventory_key":"wikipedia:Gelderland:voermanmuseumhattem:hattem","name":"Voerman Museum Hattem","city":"Hattem","province":"Gelderland","street_address":"Achterstraat 46-48","postal_code":"8051 GC","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.voermanmuseumhattem.nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Zie de IJssel en de natuur door de ogen van vader en zoon Voerman. Hun schilderijen en illustraties vormen een belangrijk deel van de collectie. Het museum verbindt deze kunstenaars met Hattem en zijn omgeving.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["landschap","schilderkunst","kunstenaarsmuseum"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Hattem_Voerman_Stadsmuseum_seen_from_the_southwest.jpg/1280px-Hattem_Voerman_Stadsmuseum_seen_from_the_southwest.jpg","caption":"Voerman Museum Hattem — Hattem Voerman Stadsmuseum seen from the southwest","credit":"Ymblanter","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hattem_Voerman_Stadsmuseum_seen_from_the_southwest.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"2a46501c-a2db-5c39-a68f-7611def83d0b","inventory_key":"museum-nl:stedelijk-museum-breda","name":"Stedelijk Museum Breda","city":"Breda","province":"Noord-Brabant","street_address":"Boschstraat 22","postal_code":"4811 GH","country":"NL","website_url":"https://stedelijkmuseumbreda.nl/","latitude":51.589639,"longitude":4.78101,"summary":"Kunst en stadsgeschiedenis komen samen in Stedelijk Museum Breda. Naast verhalen over de stad ontdek je beeldende kunst in wisselende tentoonstellingen. Oude en nieuwe perspectieven nodigen uit om Breda anders te bekijken.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["schilderkunst","hedendaagse kunst"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Breda_Stedelijk_Museum_voorkant_2024-09-02.jpg/1280px-Breda_Stedelijk_Museum_voorkant_2024-09-02.jpg","caption":"Stedelijk Museum Breda — Breda Stedelijk Museum voorkant 2024-09-02","credit":"Renée Kools","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Breda_Stedelijk_Museum_voorkant_2024-09-02.jpg","license":"CC BY 4.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"69e35ede-847c-54a8-b8cf-e47b20c92837","inventory_key":"museum-nl:museum-more-kasteel-ruurlo","name":"Museum MORE | Kasteel Ruurlo","city":"Ruurlo","province":"Gelderland","street_address":"Vordenseweg 2","postal_code":"7261 LZ","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.museummore-kasteelruurlo.nl/","latitude":52.078833,"longitude":6.445037,"summary":"Ontdek de raadselachtige wereld van Carel Willink in Kasteel Ruurlo. Zijn schilderijen combineren nauwkeurigheid met onwerkelijke spanning. Creaties van Fong Leng voegen kleur en theatrale vormgeving toe aan de ontmoeting met deze kunstenaar.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["magisch realisme","schilderkunst","Carel Willink","mode"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Ruurlo%2C_huize_Ruurlo_RM32992_foto2_2012-07-22_11.29.jpg/1280px-Ruurlo%2C_huize_Ruurlo_RM32992_foto2_2012-07-22_11.29.jpg","caption":"Museum MORE | Kasteel Ruurlo — Ruurlo, huize Ruurlo RM32992 foto2 2012-07-22 11.29","credit":"Michielverbeek","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ruurlo,_huize_Ruurlo_RM32992_foto2_2012-07-22_11.29.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0 nl"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"b733d593-f4cc-55ef-a4ea-0d3eff1bd76c","inventory_key":"museum-nl:schunck","name":"SCHUNCK","city":"Heerlen","province":"Limburg","street_address":"Bongerd 18","postal_code":"6411 JM","country":"NL","website_url":"https://schunck.nl/","latitude":50.887944,"longitude":5.979259,"summary":"Laat je verrassen door moderne en hedendaagse kunst in het Glaspaleis. SCHUNCK verzamelt Nederlandse schilderkunst en werk van Aad de Haas. Wisselende tentoonstellingen verbinden die verzamelingen met actuele makers en ideeën.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["moderne kunst","hedendaagse kunst","schilderkunst"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Glaspaleis_front-east.jpg/1280px-Glaspaleis_front-east.jpg","caption":"SCHUNCK — Glaspaleis front-east","credit":"DirkvdM at English Wikipedia","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Glaspaleis_front-east.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"c2ab51c6-5835-5cdb-b14c-0d8f2e1d580a","inventory_key":"museum-nl:jopie-huisman-museum","name":"Jopie Huisman Museum","city":"Workum","province":"Friesland","street_address":"Noard 6","postal_code":"8711 AH","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.jopiehuismanmuseum.nl/","latitude":52.979778,"longitude":5.443705,"summary":"Versleten schoenen en gewone mensen worden bijzonder in de schilderijen van Jopie Huisman. Zijn nauwkeurige blik geeft waardigheid aan wat vaak over het hoofd wordt gezien. Ontdek de kunstenaar, zijn verhalen en zijn verbondenheid met Friesland.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["realisme","kunstenaarsmuseum","schilderkunst"],"photos":[{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/JopieHmuseum.jpg","caption":"Jopie Huisman Museum — JopieHmuseum","credit":"Gerritse at Dutch Wikipedia","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:JopieHmuseum.jpg","license":"Public domain"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"c94f7d64-cee0-5e3e-ac58-5967dc5772cf","inventory_key":"museum-nl:galerij-prins-willem-v","name":"Galerij Prins Willem V","city":"Den Haag","province":"Zuid-Holland","street_address":"Buitenhof 33","postal_code":"2513 AH","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.mauritshuis.nl/nl-nl/ontdek/galerij-prins-willem-v/","latitude":52.079596,"longitude":4.310279,"summary":"Kijk van vloer tot plafond naar schilderijen in de galerij van prins Willem V. De historische opstelling laat je de overvloed van een vorstelijke verzameling ervaren. Een intieme ontmoeting met oude meesters midden in Den Haag.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["oude meesters","schilderkunst"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Den_Haag_-_Buitenhof_-_Galerij_Prins_Willem_V_-_Outdoor_Entrance.jpg/1280px-Den_Haag_-_Buitenhof_-_Galerij_Prins_Willem_V_-_Outdoor_Entrance.jpg","caption":"Galerij Prins Willem V — Den Haag - Buitenhof - Galerij Prins Willem V - Outdoor Entrance","credit":"Txllxt TxllxT","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Den_Haag_-_Buitenhof_-_Galerij_Prins_Willem_V_-_Outdoor_Entrance.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"is_art_museum":true}]'::jsonb)
 on conflict(id) do update set inventory_key=excluded.inventory_key,name=excluded.name,city=excluded.city,province=excluded.province,street_address=excluded.street_address,postal_code=excluded.postal_code,country=excluded.country,website_url=excluded.website_url,latitude=excluded.latitude,longitude=excluded.longitude,summary=excluded.summary,operating_status=excluded.operating_status,publication_status=excluded.publication_status,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,tags=excluded.tags,photos=excluded.photos,is_art_museum=excluded.is_art_museum
 where not m.is_art_museum and m.publication_status='draft'
 and not exists(select 1 from kunstkiezer_private.museum_changes c where c.museum_id=m.id and c.editor_id is not null)
 returning id
) insert into kk_art_changed select id from changed;
